d2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_def_other_secondary"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"安全性终点：治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率。；实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。","quote_sha256":"99133b9298d6b094501b14430ac89a3b690a9aa9acb4bb1df325ea3196a44236","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_def_safety"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"依从：通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性","quote_sha256":"bae98d5756fc33d2dec389859c413b44261174683ee2abd68620571e65357c06","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_def_adherence"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sel_10_1","span_def_periods","span_def_visits","span_def_other_secondary","span_def_safety","span_def_adherence"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"heading":"病例报告表","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究病例报告表用于记录筛选期、双盲治疗期及安全性随访期内采集的研究数据。疗效相关记录包括PASI和sPGA在基线及第4、8、12、16周的评估结果，以及第16周DLQI评分较基线变化的评价数据；安全性相关记录包括治疗期间出现的不良事件、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件，以及实验室检查、生命体征和12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化；依从性相关记录包括药品计数和受试者日记。病例报告表的记录范围与上述评价变量及访视安排相对应。","rationale":"正文依据已确认的研究时期与访视安排、疗效与安全性评价变量及依从性评价方式撰写，明确了病例报告表需覆盖的记录范围。医学作者需核对并补充病例报告表的记录载体、填写与更正要求、签字流程及数据核查安排等项目实施细节，并确认其与数据管理相关文件一致。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_ae1d1fb8450d1498","section_number":"10.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:2de7e41732231a1430ee0b61","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:28e671543798db"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922055223_31960bba","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:2de7e41732231a1430ee0b61","quote":"章节编号=10.2\n章节标题=数据源的定义\n章节类型=section\n当前正文=（当前为空，需生成实质正文）","quote_sha256":"cea785a8ee796541e29b098db672897e0f8d992eb32acde781e0ec6fe4b4b92f","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:2de7e41732231a1430ee0b61","span_id":"span_sel_10_2"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"8c7a570d51b842be51c8689066b3d6fe50030b8229d96708644c920d085e82c5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_def_visits"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"其他次要终点：第16周PASI评分较基线的变化。；第16周DLQI评分较基线的变化。","quote_sha256":"1f739c14310a6a5f292991854360290460a4b501e71c36ec724647d8123a4023","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_def_other_secondary"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"安全性终点：治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率。；实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。","quote_sha256":"99133b9298d6b094501b14430ac89a3b690a9aa9acb4bb1df325ea3196a44236","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_def_safety"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"依从：通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性","quote_sha256":"bae98d5756fc33d2dec389859c413b44261174683ee2abd68620571e65357c06","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_def_adherence"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sel_10_2","span_def_visits","span_def_other_secondary","span_def_safety","span_def_adherence"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"heading":"数据源的定义","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究疗效数据来源于PASI和sPGA在基线及第4、8、12、16周的评估结果，以及第16周DLQI评分较基线变化的评价数据；安全性数据来源于治疗期间出现的不良事件、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件的记录，以及实验室检查、生命体征和12导联心电图的检查结果；依从性数据来源于药品计数和受试者日记。上述数据按评价时点形成记录并汇总于病例报告表，作为研究数据分析的数据基础。","rationale":"正文依据已确认的评价变量、访视安排及依从性评价方式界定各类数据的来源。医学作者需补充源数据与源文件的界定、实验室检查等外部数据的来源与传输方式、数据录入与核查责任等项目实施细节，并确认其与数据管理相关文件一致。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_853d5ef9216b528b","section_number":"10.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:2de7e41732231a1430ee0b61","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:28e671543798db"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922055223_31960bba","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:2de7e41732231a1430ee0b61","quote":"章节编号=10.3\n章节标题=数据质量保证\n章节类型=section\n当前正文=（当前为空，需生成实质正文）","quote_sha256":"7d5f27abe13f858ee8c8e5d80c5b469c79db2ca69bffe816b3cbeafbbd692b4a","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:2de7e41732231a1430ee0b61","span_id":"span_sel_10_3"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"中心模式：多中心","quote_sha256":"2cfa68bc992967c797bbd3113b5e0d0844d660a2050095a31f08358c5e40311f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_def_center"},{"locator":"section:数据质量保证|block:932|chunk:1","quote":"研究中心质量保证人员对数据转移文件、统计报告数据进行抽查，保证数据准确无误。","quote_sha256":"179c98be037bd895386e5ae15ae990c35e75ad82cab9d0ac6d7abd65c44c1ed1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:28e671543798db","span_id":"span_corpus_qa_1"},{"locator":"section:数据质量保证|block:932|chunk:1","quote":"申办者根据需要，结合试验进展情况及质量控制人员/监查员的核查结果，可对上述临床研究过程产生的数据进行不同范畴的稽查。","quote_sha256":"08e7229a310fcfe753e2aba87e62e2718cdc239631d05892b1ae7226dab40ff2","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:28e671543798db","span_id":"span_corpus_qa_2"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sel_10_3","span_def_center","span_corpus_qa_1","span_corpus_qa_2"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":2,"project_fact_spans":1},"heading":"数据质量保证","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为多中心研究，数据质量保证覆盖数据采集、数据转移及统计分析过程。研究中心质量保证人员对数据转移文件、统计报告数据进行抽查，以保证数据准确无误；申办者可根据研究进展情况及质量控制人员、监查员的核查结果，对研究过程中产生的数据进行不同范畴的稽查。","rationale":"正文基于多中心设计及质量保证相关依据撰写，涵盖数据抽查与稽查机制。医学作者需核对质量保证职责分工、抽查范围与稽查流程是否与本项目质量管理文件一致，并确认该质量保证表述对本项目的适用性。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_92c510d2c44bc5b4","section_number":"10.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:2de7e41732231a1430ee0b61","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:28e671543798db"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922055223_31960bba","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"资料保存与数据保护","missing_source_classes":["资料保存与归档管理相关的项目文件","数据保护与受试者隐私合规相关的项目文件"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"现有项目来源未提供资料保存与数据保护的要求，缺少保存期限、归档方式、责任主体及受试者个人信息保护措施的具体依据，无法形成可写入本章的实质性条文。医学作者需依据适用法规、研究机构及申办者管理要求取得相应来源后确定本章内容。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_54b16d7c77a11828","section_number":"10.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:2de7e41732231a1430ee0b61","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:28e671543798db"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:2de7e41732231a1430ee0b61","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:2de7e41732231a1430ee0b61","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","text_sha256":"16485d8c3f1d5694d853120c46a80788acf03ec34cdc665be7b0cc2dbf0e9557"}